lätze: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.680434,9.859655">P1</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.682069,9.853734">P2</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.687905,9.838595">P3</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.683303,9.835336">P4</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.682982,9.832438">P5</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.679129,9.825572">P6</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.677937,9.828876">P7</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.672902,9.811872">P8</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.671450,9.813312">P9</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.666341,9.806209">P10</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.666804,9.801982">P11</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.664291,9.785773">P12</a> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=47.657846,9.785794">P13</a><br><img src="https://altipard.github.io/gewaesser/fotos/obere-argen-5d2664.jpg" width="300"><br><img src="https://altipard.github.io/gewaesser/fotos/obere-argen-4feb6c.jpg" width="300"><br>]]></description><styleUrl>#fl</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>9.785379,47.650988,0 9.786109,47.651118,0 9.786742,47.651263,0 9.787085,47.651458,0 9.787439,47.651798,0 9.787546,47.652123,0 9.787578,47.652419,0 9.787428,47.652723,0 9.787342,47.652817,0 9.785926,47.653857,0 9.785851,47.654052,0 9.785937,47.654269,0 9.78613,47.654493,0 9.786838,47.655187,0 9.787085,47.655592,0 9.787171,47.655953,0 9.786913,47.65617,0 9.786355,47.65643,0 9.785991,47.656734,0 9.785583,47.657167,0 9.78539,47.657543,0 9.785433,47.657919,0 9.786034,47.659277,0 9.786591,47.659639,0 9.787299,4